init.description:
These bindings were on {device} before, but weren't there in the last two checks:

{bindings}

This happens when a device is factory reset, re-paired, or loses its binding table after a firmware update. A remote or switch then stops controlling its lights.

reapply.description:
The integration will bind these again with zha-toolkit and then read {device}'s binding table to check:

{bindings}

If {device} runs on battery, press a button on it now to wake it, then select Submit straight away.

forget.description:
The integration will stop expecting these on {device}:

{bindings}

Nothing is sent to the device.
